@startuml F3.7-D01-listar-tccs
title F3.7-D01 — Listar TCCs para avaliação
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "TccController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: /tccs?to=me
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /tccs?to=me
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT orientação\nou banca
note right of Ctrl
  _links.avaliar se arquivo
  final e estado permite
end note
Postgres --> Ctrl: page
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 + _links
WebApp --> Prof: fila de TCCs

@enduml
